---
description: Conventions for the St. Joseph University Research ERP
globs:
  - "**/*.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: true
---

- TypeScript is strict. Do not use `any`. Prefer explicit types from `/types`.
- Server Components are the default. Add `"use client"` only for interactivity, browser APIs, or form state.
- Do not hard-code page content inside components. Lists, copy, and mock records live in `/data`. The university name and contact details live in `/lib/constants.ts`.
- Reuse the design tokens in `/styles/theme.css` and the primitives in `/components/ui`. Do not introduce one-off hex colours in components.
- Roles are `scholar | supervisor | admin`.
- Every form validates with zod. Client forms use react-hook-form with the zod resolver.
- File-size and file-type limits live in `/lib/constants.ts` (`fileLimits`). Do not hard-code kilobyte limits in components.
- Add new modules through the existing public, auth, and portal layouts. Do not rewrite shared shells for a single page.
- Mock authentication stays in `/lib/auth.ts` until a real auth provider is introduced.
